# An aborted rewrite still moves the alias to its partly built copy.
MODULE: AbortTouchesNothingAbortPublishes
TARGET: AbortTouchesNothing
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an aborted rewrite cuts over
PERTURBS: BuildRewrite

--- FIND
               /\ UNCHANGED <<stored, wal, phys, intended, cap, promised>>
--- REPLACE
               /\ phys' = 2
               /\ UNCHANGED <<stored, wal, intended, cap, promised>>
--- END
